# Graph Audit Findings — <loop-id> v<X.Y.Z>

> Canonical fillable form for the verifier profile's V-of-V artifact. The report is the operator-facing surface the operator reads at HITL #2 to disposition PROMOTE / DEFER / ARCHIVE per `op-guard-29` + `op-guard-32`. **§4 Graph (Mermaid) is REQUIRED** — the report is FAIL if absent (per `methodology/M-decide-graph-readiness.md` v0.2.7 Part 4 §B.5 + Part 5 check 9; this template is the canonical compliance surface for DRY-RUN-5 success criterion 2 fix, ticket `t_3a6b8cfe`). For DRY-RUN placeholder loops (per amend-123; `trigger.kind: none` + zero child nodes — e.g., `graph-audit-dry-run-test-loop-5`), §4 carries a labeled sentinel Mermaid block rather than a missing section.

