## 1. What was audited

- **Loop id:** `<loop-id>`
- **Loop version:** `v<X.Y.Z>`
- **Status (pre-audit):** `<live-pending-test | live>`
- **Intent doc:** `~/.hermes/loops/intents/<loop-id>-intent.md` (version `<X.Y.Z>`)
- **Yaml entry:** `~/.hermes/loops/hermes.yaml` line `<N>` (loop entry id `<loop-id>`)
- **Master ticket:** `<t_xxx>` (filed on `<board>` board)
- **Per-loop audit ticket:** `<t_xxx>` (assignee=`doc-writer`)
- **Verdict this audit:** `<PASS | FAIL | PARTIAL-PASS>` — see §2 + §3 below.

