## 3. Per-item evidence (6 verifier gates)

### 3.1 Item 1 — methodology doc
- **Source of truth:** `~/Documents/alice-framework/methodology/M-decide-<loop-name>.md` (or `04a-decide-work-graph.md` for cross-cutting) + the `links:` field naming this loop id.
- **Sub-check (item 1, doc-accurately-describes-behavior per Part 5 check 3d):** `<PASS | FAIL>` — the methodology doc's per-node descriptions match the actual child tickets' worker profiles / scopes / outcomes.
- **Evidence:** `<file path + line range OR audit-line id>`.

### 3.2 Item 2 — intent doc + version bump
- **Source of truth:** `~/.hermes/loops/intents/<loop-id>-intent.md` — frontmatter `version:` field tracks semver per `loop-updater` discipline.
- **Evidence:** `<file path + frontmatter excerpt>`.

### 3.3 Item 4 — regression suite + behavior-vs-tautology sub-check
- **Source of truth:** `~/.hermes/tests/test_<loop_id>_*.py` (or `test_<loop_id>_<aspect>_*.py`).
- **Sub-check (item 4, behavior-vs-tautology per Part 5 check 1d):** `<PASS | FAIL>` — classifier verdict per `~/.hermes/tools/verifier_test_classifier.py` (`{tautology_count, trivial_count, behavior_count}`).
- **Evidence:** `<pytest output + classifier report>`.

### 3.4 Item 6 — paired-wiki integrity + atomicity sub-check
- **Source of truth:** same-change-set check + `git log --format=%H --grep='<change set name>' -10` per Part 5 check 4d.
- **Sub-check (item 6, atomicity per Part 5 check 4d):** `<PASS | FAIL>` — no intermediate commit where one artifact shipped without the others.
- **Evidence:** `<git log excerpt + kanban_complete file-list>`.

### 3.5 Item 8 — end-to-end run + run-success sub-check
- **Source of truth:** `kanban show <loop_run_card>` per Part 5 check 2c — terminal status must be `done`, not `blocked`, not `running-then-blocked`. Retry storm threshold: `<3` retries in a 5-min window. Escalation threshold: `0` `operator-action-dm` triggers tied to this run.
- **Evidence:** `<run card id + terminal status + retry count + escalation count>`.

### 3.6 Item 9 — node-type discipline
- **Source of truth:** methodology doc + intent doc per Part 5 check 8 — every node has a type (Human / Scripts/Code / Agents) + rationale documented.
- **Evidence:** `<design doc section + per-node type table>`.

