## 4. Graph (Mermaid) — REQUIRED

> **This section is REQUIRED** per `methodology/M-decide-graph-readiness.md` v0.2.7 Part 4 §B.5 + Part 5 check 9. The verifier emits a FAIL when this section is missing or when the Mermaid block fails the syntax check. The canonical Mermaid helper is `~/.hermes/tools/graph_to_mermaid.py` v0.1.0 (sister tool to `~/.hermes/tools/post_graph_audit_disposition_pdf.py` v0.6.1). For DRY-RUN placeholder loops (per amend-123; `trigger.kind: none` + zero child nodes), this section carries a labeled sentinel Mermaid block rather than a missing section — see "DRY-RUN sentinel" subsection below.

