### 4.2 DRY-RUN sentinel (placeholder loops ONLY — per amend-123)

For DRY-RUN placeholder loops (e.g., `graph-audit-dry-run-test-loop-5` v0.0.1-dryrun, `trigger.kind: none`, zero child nodes), render the labeled sentinel block below INSTEAD of the empty 4.1 block:

```mermaid
graph TD
  A[<loop-id>: dry-run-placeholder per amend-123]
  style A fill:#eee
```

The sentinel is NOT a FAIL per Part 5 check 9(d). The canonical helper v0.1.0 emits the sentinel automatically when `loop_yaml_entry.trigger.kind == "none"` AND the loop has no children in the chain.

### 4.3 Mermaid syntax validation

- **Helper mode:** `python3 ~/.hermes/tools/graph_to_mermaid.py --loop-id <loop-id> --validate-mermaid-syntax-only`
- **Sanitizer:** `_sanitize_mermaid_label` per `post_graph_audit_disposition_pdf.py` v0.6.1 contract (`-->` → `→`, `\\n` → `<br/>`, backtick + double-quote escaping, whitespace collapse).
- **On render error:** FAIL with `compliance: fail — findings-report-mermaid-invalid — <loop-id> v<X.Y.Z>: <render error message>`.

