## 7. HITL #2 prompt (operator disposition)

The operator dispositions HITL #2 via `clarify` per `op-guard-24` + `op-guard-28` + `op-guard-29` + `op-guard-32`. Canonical prompt format:

```
<loop-id> audit findings ready. Score: <N>/6 verifier + <HITL-y/n> + <flip-y/n>.
9-item rubric: see §2 + §3. Mermaid graph: see §4.
Findings: <count open / count resolved> (see §6).
Disposition:

1. PROMOTE — flip yaml status: to live + bump intent doc version: + audit-line
2. DEFER — keep at live-pending-test; re-disposition at next audit cycle
3. ARCHIVE — close the loop with closed_per_decision per op-guard-10 v2 §1.3

choice: <PROMOTE | DEFER | ARCHIVE>  — decision_ref: clarify-<ISO-timestamp>-disposition
```

